                            <span>Fresh Red Snapper and Squid</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rd-amenity">
                            <span class="rd-amenity-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="20" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="20" fill="currentColor"><path d="M280-80v-366q-51-14-85.5-56T160-600v-280h80v280h40v-280h80v280h40v-280h80v280q0 56-34.5 98T360-446v366h-80Zm400 0v-320H560v-280q0-83 58.5-141.5T760-880v800h-80Z"/></svg></span>
                            <span>Filipino Barbecue Skewers</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rd-amenity">
                            <span class="rd-amenity-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="20" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="20" fill="currentColor"><path d="m734-556-56-58 86-84 56 56-86 86ZM80-160v-80h800v80H80Zm360-520v-120h80v120h-80ZM226-558l-84-86 56-56 86 86-58 56Zm71 158h366q-23-54-72-87t-111-33q-62 0-111 33t-72 87Zm-97 80q0-117 81.5-198.5T480-600q117 0 198.5 81.5T760-320H200Zm280-80Z"/></svg></span>
                            <span>Dining Under the Stars</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rd-amenity">
                            <span class="rd-amenity-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="20" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="20" fill="currentColor"><path d="m612-292 56-56-148-148v-184h-80v216l172 172ZM480-80q-83 0-156-31.5T197-197q-54-54-85.5-127T80-480q0-83 31.5-156T197-763q54-54 127-85.5T480-880q83 0 156 31.5T763-763q54 54 85.5 127T880-480q0 83-31.5 156T763-197q-54 54-127 85.5T480-80Zm0-80q134 0 227-93t93-227q0-134-93-227t-227-93q-134 0-227 93t-93 227q0 134 93 227t227 93Zm0-320Z"/></svg></span>
                            <span>Late Night Food Service</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rd-amenity">
                            <span class="rd-amenity-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="20" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="20" fill="currentColor"><path d="M480-80q-83 0-156-31.5T197-197q-54-54-85.5-127T80-480q0-83 31.5-156T197-763q54-54 127-85.5T480-880q83 0 156 31.5T763-763q54 54 85.5 127T880-480q0 83-31.5 156T763-197q-54 54-127 85.5T480-80Zm0-80q134 0 227-93t93-227q0-134-93-227t-227-93q-134 0-227 93t-93 227q0 134 93 227t227 93Zm0-320Z"/></svg></span>
